{"content":[{"c":["SHAMMAH"],"sourceClass":"h1","t":"p"},{"c":["1. One of Reuel’s four sons, the grandson of Esau and a chief in the land of Edom (",{"href":"?bref=Gen.36.13,17","r":"Gen.36.13,17","rawR":"Gen.36.13,17","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Gen.36.13,17","value":"Gen.36.13,17"}],"t":"ref","v":"Gn 36:13, 17"},"; ",{"href":"?bref=1Chr.1.37","r":"1Chr.1.37","rawR":"1Chr.1.37","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"1Chr.1.37","value":"1Chr.1.37"}],"t":"ref","v":"1 Chr 1:37"},")."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"},{"c":["2. Third of Jesse’s eight sons, the brother of David (",{"href":"?bref=1Sam.16.9","r":"1Sam.16.9","rawR":"1Sam.16.9","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"1Sam.16.9","value":"1Sam.16.9"}],"t":"ref","v":"1 Sm 16:9"},"; ",{"href":"?bref=1Sam.17.13","r":"1Sam.17.13","rawR":"1Sam.17.13","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"1Sam.17.13","value":"1Sam.17.13"}],"t":"ref","v":"17:13"},") and the father of Jonathan (",{"href":"?bref=2Sam.21.20-21","r":"2Sam.21.20-21","rawR":"2Sam.21.20-21","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"2Sam.21.20-21","value":"2Sam.21.20-21"}],"t":"ref","v":"2 Sm 21:20-21"},") and Jonadab (",{"href":"?bref=2Sam.13.3-39","r":"2Sam.13.3-39","rawR":"2Sam.13.3-39","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"2Sam.13.3-39","value":"2Sam.13.3-39"}],"t":"ref","v":"2 Sm 13:3ff"},".). Shammah is alternately called Shimea in ",{"href":"?bref=1Chr.2.13","r":"1Chr.2.13","rawR":"1Chr.2.13","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"1Chr.2.13","value":"1Chr.2.13"}],"t":"ref","v":"1 Chronicles 2:13"}," and ",{"href":"?bref=1Chr.20.7","r":"1Chr.20.7","rawR":"1Chr.20.7","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"1Chr.20.7","value":"1Chr.20.7"}],"t":"ref","v":"20:7"},", Shimeah in ",{"href":"?bref=2Sam.13.3","r":"2Sam.13.3","rawR":"2Sam.13.3","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"2Sam.13.3","value":"2Sam.13.3"}],"t":"ref","v":"2 Samuel 13:3"},", and Shimei in ",{"href":"?bref=2Sam.21.21","r":"2Sam.21.21","rawR":"2Sam.21.21","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"2Sam.21.21","value":"2Sam.21.21"}],"t":"ref","v":"21:21"},"."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"},{"c":["3. Son of Agee the Hararite and one of the elite among David’s mighty men. He was renowned for his valiant stand against the Philistines at Lehi (",{"href":"?bref=2Sam.23.11-12","r":"2Sam.23.11-12","rawR":"2Sam.23.11-12","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"2Sam.23.11-12","value":"2Sam.23.11-12"}],"t":"ref","v":"2 Sm 23:11-12"},")."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"},{"c":["4. Harodite and one of David’s 30 valiant warriors. He was listed between Elhanan and Elika (",{"href":"?bref=2Sam.23.24-25","r":"2Sam.23.24-25","rawR":"2Sam.23.24-25","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"2Sam.23.24-25","value":"2Sam.23.24-25"}],"t":"ref","v":"2 Sm 23:24-25"},"). The parallel passage of ",{"href":"?bref=1Chr.11.27","r":"1Chr.11.27","rawR":"1Chr.11.27","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"1Chr.11.27","value":"1Chr.11.27"}],"t":"ref","v":"1 Chronicles 11:27"}," reads Shammoth, the plural form of Shammah. In ",{"href":"?bref=1Chr.27.8","r":"1Chr.27.8","rawR":"1Chr.27.8","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"1Chr.27.8","value":"1Chr.27.8"}],"t":"ref","v":"27:8"}," Shamhuth the Irahite, the commander of a division of David’s soldiers, is no doubt the same man."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"},{"c":["5. Hararite and one of David’s mighty men, listed between Jonathan and Ahiam (",{"href":"?bref=2Sam.23.33","r":"2Sam.23.33","rawR":"2Sam.23.33","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"2Sam.23.33","value":"2Sam.23.33"}],"t":"ref","v":"2 Sm 23:33"},")."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"}],"format":"bsb-study-dictionary-v2","id":"Shammah","provenance":{"archiveSha256":"10758ea00dbea7540f9337e43e59c8e4000295c1261e3426bab6f31c31dcff5b","release":"1.6","sourceCitationReferences":[{"anchorText":"Gn 36:13, 17","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Gen.36.13,17","rawQueryValue":"Gen.36.13,17","sourceRefExact":"Gen.36.13,17"},{"anchorText":"1 Chr 1:37","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=1Chr.1.37","rawQueryValue":"1Chr.1.37","sourceRefExact":"1Chr.1.37"},{"anchorText":"1 Sm 16:9","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"